    "translation_tagged": "船乗りは手すりに身を預け、目を大きく見開いて言った。「旦那さま、ご冗談でしょう？」",
    "raw_tagged": "The sailor leaned on the railing, opened his eyes wide, and said, “Is your honour joking?”",
